msgid "日期: 2026-08-24"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:5
#: 99b763719fd14592b5e045dec64a1099
msgid "状态: 提议 (Accepted)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:7
#: 3f39f7577e6440b6a0a41957435354e5
msgid "上下文"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:9
#: b0d2f4c059c34d4b9de96c27349bc8fb
msgid ""
"自 v4.0.0 迁移至 Tauri 桌面应用后，CI 仅构建 Windows NSIS 安装器（.exe）。Linux "
"用户需要免安装的即开即用版本（直接运行）以及面向 Debian/Ubuntu 体系的标准安装包。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:11
#: a742258982404997a91422b664c7b808
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:13
#: a620c86f0e94481f872d3256a61aabff
msgid "**分发包形态**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:14
#: bd8b18df4f8f4631939c9e86135cace7
msgid ""
"**AppImage**：真正的免安装单文件独立运行格式（内嵌 WebKitGTK 运行时桥接与 PyInstaller 打包的 Linux "
"ELF sidecar 单文件，赋予执行权限后双击即可运行）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:15
#: 816aba0e543e44d389e7d9b06571ed96
msgid "**.deb**：Ubuntu / Debian 标准系统包（支持系统应用菜单与包管理器管理）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:16
#: 8d44a8d151a94dc0bfdf8aeb3beea7a9
msgid ""
"沿用 `packaging/tauri.release.conf.json` 分发配置，将 targets 统一设为 `[\"nsis\", "
"\"appimage\", \"deb\"]`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:18
#: b75a2cb73c394f8e9b8cb7a3f78f2ba9
msgid "**构建平台与 glibc 兼容性基线**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:19
#: e971252739014d73b80feea101e415e0
msgid ""
"Linux 构建运行在 `ubuntu-22.04` runner 上，编译出的二进制依赖 `glibc >= 2.35`，覆盖 Ubuntu "
"22.04/24.04、Debian 12、Fedora 37+、Arch 等绝大多数主流现代 Linux 桌面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:21
#: 54e6445639874275bf14977a79e0a66b
msgid "**sidecar 与资源随包契约**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:22
#: 3e4c518ea62f45d397bf3dc23423aaa8
msgid ""
"PyInstaller 运行在 Linux 环境，利用 `packaging/tod_sidecar.spec` 构建出单文件 ELF 二进制 "
"`dist/tod-sidecar`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:23
#: 638d526a668c4425864308aed6e284a3
msgid ""
"Tauri resource 将小内核（`kernels/`）与 `tod-sidecar` 复制到 `src-tauri/binaries"
"/tod-sidecar` 随 AppImage / deb 打包。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:24
#: 6ef48eed994745df91d2238b60a9e41c
msgid ""
"运行时由 Tauri 壳在 `resource_dir` 下拉起 "
"sidecar，星历大内核沿用用户数据目录（`~/.local/share/tod/kernels`）按需解析。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:26
#: 075cadccc6ca4091946adfbb39c3c528
msgid "**CI Release 工作流更新**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:27
#: 317267928d0f415699f639932bf087e7
msgid ""
"在 `.github/workflows/release.yml` 中新增 `build-linux` 独立 job（并行于 `build-"
"windows`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:28
#: 3f84b0bb9074414a8c3940d042d56665
msgid "自动将构建产物（`*.AppImage`, `*.deb`）直传 GitHub Release 资产。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:30
#: ff9a6e245fcb4c5786652ac93f4af0f4
msgid "结果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:32
#: 8fd2ba44d1214c219b06842fb80ec621
msgid "Linux 用户获得了开箱即用（AppImage）与包管理器安装（deb）的完整支持。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:33
#: 6e9190db3f464857a8d0423f47a97171
msgid "全平台分发链路（Windows + Linux）完全对称且自动化。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0017-linux-appimage-and-deb-packaging.md:35
#: 74fc39c6b1094e44a8055028c69e2c0c
msgid ""
"**修订**（2026-08-26 复核）：应用改名 tod → transfer-orbit-design 后，spec 与 产物名为 "
"`packaging/transfer_orbit_design_sidecar.spec` 与 `dist/transfer-orbit-"
"design-sidecar`；且内核（含行星历）经 Git LFS 随包分发， 不再依赖 "
"`~/.local/share/tod/kernels` 按需解析。以 `.github/workflows/release.yml` 为准。"
msgstr ""

